## Artifact format

- `submission/config.toml` + `submission/solution/*.asc` hold the kernel; read `.agents/skills/ascendc/SKILL.md` for the bundle format, compiler flags, tensor ABI, and stream rules.
- `kernel.json` is regenerated from `submission/` by the evaluation command; do not hand-edit it.
- Every evaluated kernel is snapshotted to `versions/version<N>/`.

